---
const frequentForms = [
  {
    base: 'schnell',
    comparative: 'schneller',
    standalone: 'am schnellsten',
    beforeNoun: 'der schnellste',
  },
  {
    base: 'alt',
    comparative: 'älter',
    standalone: 'am ältesten',
    beforeNoun: 'der älteste',
  },
  {
    base: 'hoch',
    comparative: 'höher',
    standalone: 'am höchsten',
    beforeNoun: 'der höchste',
  },
  {
    base: 'gut',
    comparative: 'besser',
    standalone: 'am besten',
    beforeNoun: 'der beste',
  },
  {
    base: 'viel',
    comparative: 'mehr',
    standalone: 'am meisten',
    beforeNoun: 'die meisten',
  },
  {
    base: 'gern',
    comparative: 'lieber',
    standalone: 'am liebsten',
    beforeNoun: '—',
  },
];
---

<section class="chapter-dashboard superlative-dashboard" aria-label="Choisir la forme du superlatif">
  <article>
    <strong>Sans nom juste après</strong>
    <p class="dashboard-rule">
      <span class="dashboard-rule-line">
        <span class="mark-superlative">am</span> + <span class="mark-adjective">adjectif</span> +
        <span class="mark-superlative">-(e)st</span><span class="mark-ending">en</span>
      </span>
      <span class="dashboard-example-line">
        Tomy läuft <span class="mark-superlative">am</span>
        <span class="mark-adjective">schnell</span><span class="mark-superlative">st</span><span class="mark-ending">en</span>.
      </span>
    </p>
  </article>

  <article>
    <strong>Devant un nom</strong>
    <p class="dashboard-rule">
      <span class="dashboard-rule-line">
        déterminant + <span class="mark-adjective">adjectif</span> +
        <span class="mark-superlative">-(e)st</span> + <span class="mark-ending">terminaison</span> + nom
      </span>
      <span class="dashboard-example-line">
        der <span class="mark-adjective">schnell</span><span class="mark-superlative">st</span><span class="mark-ending">e</span> Läufer
      </span>
    </p>
  </article>

  <article>
    <strong>Dans un groupe</strong>
    <p>Le superlatif désigne l’élément qui atteint le degré le plus élevé parmi plusieurs.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<div class="grammar-callout">
  <strong>Le test le plus simple</strong>
  <p>
    Si un nom suit directement, accorde le superlatif comme un adjectif.
    Sinon, utilise généralement la forme avec <span class="mark-superlative">am</span>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mini-table-grid" aria-label="Exemples de superlatif">
  <article>
    <strong>Sans nom</strong>
    <p>
      Der Ferrari fährt <span class="mark-superlative">am</span>
      <span class="mark-adjective">schnell</span><span class="mark-superlative">st</span><span class="mark-ending">en</span>.
    </p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <strong>Nom masculin</strong>
    <p>
      der <span class="mark-adjective">höch</span><span class="mark-superlative">st</span><span class="mark-ending">e</span> Berg
    </p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <strong>Pluriel</strong>
    <p>
      die <span class="mark-adjective">grös</span><span class="mark-superlative">st</span><span class="mark-ending">en</span> Schuhe
    </p>
  </article>
</div>

<p>
  Devant un nom, <span class="mark-superlative">-st-</span> marque le superlatif ;
  <span class="mark-ending">-e</span> ou <span class="mark-ending">-en</span> est la terminaison de l’adjectif.
  Compare <strong>der höchste Berg</strong> et <strong>die höchsten Berge</strong>.
</p>

<details class="lesson-card">
  <summary>Formes fréquentes à retenir</summary>
  <div class="lesson-card-content">
    <p>
      Certaines formes ajoutent un <strong>e</strong> ou changent de radical.
      Les plus fréquentes s’apprennent comme une petite famille.
    </p>
    <div class="comparative-table comparative-table-compact" role="table" aria-label="Comparatif et superlatif de formes fréquentes">
      <div class="comparative-table-head" role="row">
        <span role="columnheader">Forme de base</span>
        <span role="columnheader">Comparatif</span>
        <span role="columnheader">Superlatif</span>
      </div>
      {
        frequentForms.map((row) => (
          <div class="comparative-table-row" role="row">
            <span role="cell" data-label="Forme de base"><strong>{row.base}</strong></span>
            <span role="cell" data-label="Comparatif">{row.comparative}</span>
            <strong role="cell" data-label="Superlatif">
              {row.standalone}
              {row.beforeNoun !== '—' && <> / {row.beforeNoun}</>}
            </strong>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <p>
      <strong>gern → lieber → am liebsten</strong> exprime une préférence.
      Il ne possède pas de forme devant un nom dans cette série.
    </p>
  </div>
</details>

